{"id":"forecast-10","section":2,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-10/audio-2.mp3","model":"small","duration":336.92,"segments":[{"start":0.08,"end":7.92,"text":"Part 2. You will hear part of a talk at a public meeting about a road and rail improvement project.","words":[["Part",0.08,0.62],["2.",0.62,1.12],["You",2.14,2.68],["will",2.68,2.88],["hear",2.88,3.12],["part",3.12,3.42],["of",3.42,3.62],["a",3.62,3.7],["talk",3.7,4.02],["at",4.02,4.26],["a",4.26,4.4],["public",4.4,4.64],["meeting",4.64,5.1],["about",5.1,5.78],["a",5.78,6.1],["road",6.1,6.3],["and",6.3,6.5],["rail",6.5,6.72],["improvement",6.72,7.3],["project.",7.3,7.92]]},{"start":8.98,"end":43.46,"text":"First, you have some time to look at questions 11 to 15. Now listen carefully and answer questions 11 to 15.","words":[["First,",8.98,9.58],["you",10.12,10.3],["have",10.3,10.48],["some",10.48,10.68],["time",10.68,11.04],["to",11.04,11.26],["look",11.26,11.38],["at",11.38,11.54],["questions",11.54,11.86],["11",11.86,12.66],["to",12.66,13.2],["15.",13.2,13.68],["Now",39.22,39.6],["listen",39.6,39.9],["carefully",39.9,40.34],["and",40.34,40.9],["answer",40.9,41.2],["questions",41.2,41.68],["11",41.68,42.4],["to",42.4,42.98],["15.",42.98,43.46]]},{"start":46.99,"end":50.25,"text":"Welcome everyone. Thanks for coming to this information evening.","words":[["Welcome",46.99,47.53],["everyone.",47.53,47.97],["Thanks",48.57,48.75],["for",48.75,48.93],["coming",48.93,49.11],["to",49.11,49.27],["this",49.27,49.43],["information",49.43,49.75],["evening.",49.75,50.25]]},{"start":51.19,"end":56.25,"text":"The purpose of this meeting is to give you a chance to learn more about the Road and Rail Improvement Project.","words":[["The",51.19,51.57],["purpose",51.57,51.79],["of",51.79,51.99],["this",51.99,52.13],["meeting",52.13,52.43],["is",52.43,52.73],["to",52.73,52.87],["give",52.87,53.03],["you",53.03,53.17],["a",53.17,53.27],["chance",53.27,53.49],["to",53.49,53.73],["learn",53.73,53.93],["more",53.93,54.19],["about",54.19,54.43],["the",54.43,54.63],["Road",54.63,54.83],["and",54.83,54.99],["Rail",54.99,55.21],["Improvement",55.21,55.85],["Project.",55.85,56.25]]},{"start":57.47,"end":61.29,"text":"We've identified several problem areas and we've come up with some changes that","words":[["We've",57.47,57.81],["identified",57.81,58.17],["several",58.17,58.75],["problem",58.75,59.17],["areas",59.17,59.59],["and",59.59,59.81],["we've",59.81,59.97],["come",59.97,60.13],["up",60.13,60.29],["with",60.29,60.43],["some",60.43,60.59],["changes",60.59,60.95],["that",60.95,61.29]]},{"start":61.29,"end":66.31,"text":"we think will improve the local environment. For the shared access paths,","words":[["we",61.29,61.85],["think",61.85,62.15],["will",62.15,62.65],["improve",62.65,62.97],["the",62.97,63.15],["local",63.15,63.35],["environment.",63.35,63.91],["For",64.69,65.23],["the",65.23,65.35],["shared",65.35,65.55],["access",65.55,65.89],["paths,",65.89,66.31]]},{"start":67.01,"end":69.93,"text":"by those I mean the paths shared by both bikes and pedestrians,","words":[["by",67.01,67.11],["those",67.11,67.31],["I",67.31,67.45],["mean",67.45,67.61],["the",67.61,67.75],["paths",67.75,68.05],["shared",68.05,68.37],["by",68.37,68.57],["both",68.57,68.79],["bikes",68.79,69.17],["and",69.17,69.51],["pedestrians,",69.51,69.93]]},{"start":71.09,"end":74.31,"text":"we plan to turn these into open areas with grass around them.","words":[["we",71.09,71.27],["plan",71.27,71.53],["to",71.53,71.67],["turn",71.67,71.87],["these",71.87,72.15],["into",72.15,72.39],["open",72.39,72.77],["areas",72.77,73.15],["with",73.15,73.39],["grass",73.39,73.71],["around",73.71,74.07],["them.",74.07,74.31]]},{"start":75.09,"end":80.05,"text":"Cyclists and pedestrians need to be able to see each other clearly to avoid any accidents.","words":[["Cyclists",75.09,75.65],["and",75.65,75.87],["pedestrians",75.87,76.37],["need",76.37,76.89],["to",76.89,77.11],["be",77.11,77.25],["able",77.25,77.39],["to",77.39,77.49],["see",77.49,77.71],["each",77.71,77.95],["other",77.95,78.11],["clearly",78.11,78.47],["to",78.47,78.87],["avoid",78.87,79.23],["any",79.23,79.57],["accidents.",79.57,80.05]]},{"start":80.79,"end":85.17,"text":"So we've decided to remove the large native trees from the area for that reason.","words":[["So",80.79,81.23],["we've",81.23,81.75],["decided",81.75,82.11],["to",82.11,82.33],["remove",82.33,82.57],["the",82.57,82.79],["large",82.79,83.15],["native",83.15,83.43],["trees",83.43,83.81],["from",83.81,84.07],["the",84.07,84.19],["area",84.19,84.47],["for",84.47,84.65],["that",84.65,84.83],["reason.",84.83,85.17]]},{"start":85.87,"end":91.19,"text":"Now, along the highway, we want to put trees that are native to this area to add shade","words":[["Now,",85.87,86.43],["along",86.87,87.13],["the",87.13,87.27],["highway,",87.27,87.59],["we",88.07,88.25],["want",88.25,88.41],["to",88.41,88.49],["put",88.49,88.67],["trees",88.67,89.03],["that",89.03,89.27],["are",89.27,89.37],["native",89.37,89.67],["to",89.67,89.89],["this",89.89,90.03],["area",90.03,90.31],["to",90.31,90.55],["add",90.55,90.87],["shade",90.87,91.19]]},{"start":91.19,"end":92.53,"text":"and make it more attractive.","words":[["and",91.19,91.55],["make",91.55,91.77],["it",91.77,91.89],["more",91.89,92.09],["attractive.",92.09,92.53]]},{"start":93.51,"end":96.73,"text":"We thought possibly the spotted gum which grows naturally here.","words":[["We",93.51,93.75],["thought",93.75,93.93],["possibly",93.93,94.41],["the",94.41,94.59],["spotted",94.59,94.87],["gum",94.87,95.17],["which",95.17,95.59],["grows",95.59,95.93],["naturally",95.93,96.37],["here.",96.37,96.73]]},{"start":97.89,"end":102.11,"text":"Now, I know those of you who live in the housing estate are disturbed by the sound","words":[["Now,",97.89,98.23],["I",98.63,98.81],["know",98.81,98.99],["those",98.99,99.33],["of",99.33,99.49],["you",99.49,99.59],["who",99.59,99.69],["live",99.69,99.87],["in",99.87,99.99],["the",99.99,100.11],["housing",100.11,100.39],["estate",100.39,100.69],["are",100.69,100.99],["disturbed",100.99,101.29],["by",101.29,101.71],["the",101.71,101.83],["sound",101.83,102.11]]},{"start":102.11,"end":102.85,"text":"of traffic nearby.","words":[["of",102.11,102.19],["traffic",102.19,102.49],["nearby.",102.49,102.85]]},{"start":103.65,"end":108.39,"text":"We are aiming to solve this problem by constructing a wall between the estate and the road","words":[["We",103.65,103.89],["are",103.89,103.99],["aiming",103.99,104.19],["to",104.19,104.41],["solve",104.41,104.65],["this",104.65,104.85],["problem",104.85,105.23],["by",105.23,105.53],["constructing",105.53,105.99],["a",105.99,106.33],["wall",106.33,106.59],["between",106.59,106.93],["the",106.93,107.13],["estate",107.13,107.51],["and",107.51,107.93],["the",107.93,108.07],["road",108.07,108.39]]},{"start":108.39,"end":112.23,"text":"and possibly in the future we might consider adding some artwork to it.","words":[["and",108.39,108.93],["possibly",108.93,109.37],["in",109.37,109.63],["the",109.63,109.71],["future",109.71,110.01],["we",110.01,110.19],["might",110.19,110.39],["consider",110.39,110.85],["adding",110.85,111.13],["some",111.13,111.35],["artwork",111.35,111.71],["to",111.71,112.07],["it.",112.07,112.23]]},{"start":112.23,"end":115.03,"text":"We think this will be quite an effective solution.","words":[["We",112.23,113.15],["think",113.15,113.29],["this",113.29,113.51],["will",113.51,113.65],["be",113.65,113.79],["quite",113.79,114.05],["an",114.05,114.19],["effective",114.19,114.49],["solution.",114.49,115.03]]},{"start":116.03,"end":120.59,"text":"Moving on now to the local roads, we want to encourage more public transport use","words":[["Moving",116.03,116.29],["on",116.29,116.49],["now",116.49,116.67],["to",116.67,116.81],["the",116.81,116.91],["local",116.91,117.15],["roads,",117.15,117.57],["we",118.13,118.43],["want",118.43,118.59],["to",118.59,118.71],["encourage",118.71,119.17],["more",119.17,119.45],["public",119.45,119.75],["transport",119.75,120.15],["use",120.15,120.59]]},{"start":120.59,"end":125.47,"text":"and solve some of our traffic problems, so we're going to add a considerable number of stops","words":[["and",120.59,121.01],["solve",121.01,121.39],["some",121.39,121.69],["of",121.69,121.81],["our",121.81,121.93],["traffic",121.93,122.21],["problems,",122.21,122.71],["so",122.91,123.37],["we're",123.37,123.51],["going",123.51,123.65],["to",123.65,123.81],["add",123.81,123.97],["a",123.97,124.07],["considerable",124.07,124.47],["number",124.47,124.95],["of",124.95,125.13],["stops",125.13,125.47]]},{"start":125.47,"end":128.35,"text":"to the bus routes that run along those roads.","words":[["to",125.47,125.71],["the",125.71,125.81],["bus",125.81,125.99],["routes",125.99,126.27],["that",126.27,126.55],["run",126.55,126.87],["along",126.87,127.47],["those",127.47,127.85],["roads.",127.85,128.35]]},{"start":129.23,"end":132.53,"text":"Just finally, as a way of thanking the community for their cooperation,","words":[["Just",129.23,129.65],["finally,",129.65,130.07],["as",130.29,130.37],["a",130.37,130.47],["way",130.47,130.59],["of",130.59,130.73],["thanking",130.73,130.99],["the",130.99,131.21],["community",131.21,131.55],["for",131.55,131.85],["their",131.85,132.01],["cooperation,",132.01,132.53]]},{"start":133.05,"end":137.05,"text":"we plan to make the picnic area in the park near the bus terminal more attractive.","words":[["we",133.05,133.21],["plan",133.21,133.43],["to",133.43,133.55],["make",133.55,133.67],["the",133.67,133.81],["picnic",133.81,134.03],["area",134.03,134.37],["in",134.37,134.59],["the",134.59,134.71],["park",134.71,135.05],["near",135.05,135.57],["the",135.57,135.69],["bus",135.69,135.89],["terminal",135.89,136.23],["more",136.23,136.55],["attractive.",136.55,137.05]]},{"start":137.05,"end":142.53,"text":"So we're adding some colourful new rose beds that our gardeners will be putting in at the completion of the project.","words":[["So",137.05,137.87],["we're",137.87,138.03],["adding",138.03,138.23],["some",138.23,138.47],["colourful",138.47,138.97],["new",138.97,139.15],["rose",139.15,139.45],["beds",139.45,139.73],["that",139.73,139.93],["our",139.93,140.07],["gardeners",140.07,140.49],["will",140.49,140.61],["be",140.61,140.73],["putting",140.73,140.97],["in",140.97,141.21],["at",141.21,141.31],["the",141.31,141.39],["completion",141.39,141.79],["of",141.79,142.01],["the",142.01,142.09],["project.",142.09,142.53]]},{"start":145.98,"end":152.04,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the talk, you have some time to look at questions 16 to 20.","words":[["Before",145.98,146.36],["you",146.36,146.62],["hear",146.62,146.86],["the",146.86,147.02],["rest",147.02,147.24],["of",147.24,147.42],["the",147.42,147.5],["talk,",147.5,147.8],["you",148.24,148.42],["have",148.42,148.6],["some",148.6,148.78],["time",148.78,149.1],["to",149.1,149.32],["look",149.32,149.46],["at",149.46,149.58],["questions",149.58,150.04],["16",150.04,151.02],["to",151.02,151.56],["20.",151.56,152.04]]},{"start":177.46,"end":181.34,"text":"Now listen and answer questions 16 to 20.","words":[["Now",177.46,177.86],["listen",177.86,178.18],["and",178.18,178.66],["answer",178.66,178.94],["questions",178.94,179.4],["16",179.4,180.42],["to",180.42,180.88],["20.",180.88,181.34]]},{"start":185.13,"end":190.19,"text":"Now I'd like to give you more information about the renovations to Richland's train station.","words":[["Now",185.13,185.35],["I'd",185.35,185.57],["like",185.57,185.71],["to",185.71,185.89],["give",185.89,186.05],["you",186.05,186.25],["more",186.25,186.75],["information",186.75,187.37],["about",187.37,187.83],["the",187.83,188.07],["renovations",188.07,188.63],["to",188.63,188.91],["Richland's",188.91,189.49],["train",189.49,189.65],["station.",189.65,190.19]]},{"start":190.87,"end":192.51,"text":"Can you all see a copy of the plan?","words":[["Can",190.87,191.11],["you",191.11,191.23],["all",191.23,191.39],["see",191.39,191.63],["a",191.63,191.79],["copy",191.79,191.97],["of",191.97,192.15],["the",192.15,192.25],["plan?",192.25,192.51]]},{"start":193.11,"end":198.49,"text":"We envisage Richland's station as more than just a train station. It'll be a","words":[["We",193.11,193.71],["envisage",193.71,194.17],["Richland's",194.17,194.71],["station",194.71,195.05],["as",195.05,195.57],["more",195.57,195.87],["than",195.87,196.07],["just",196.07,196.27],["a",196.27,196.41],["train",196.41,196.65],["station.",196.65,197.13],["It'll",197.61,197.79],["be",197.79,198.05],["a",198.05,198.49]]},{"start":198.49,"end":204.43,"text":"transport hub, linking all forms of transport in the area. To this end we're","words":[["transport",198.49,198.91],["hub,",198.91,199.27],["linking",199.87,200.23],["all",200.23,200.61],["forms",200.61,200.95],["of",200.95,201.11],["transport",201.11,201.57],["in",201.57,201.79],["the",201.79,201.89],["area.",201.89,202.19],["To",203.03,203.23],["this",203.23,203.43],["end",203.43,203.79],["we're",203.79,204.43]]},{"start":204.43,"end":208.83,"text":"building an underground park and ride car park, so commuters can drive to the","words":[["building",204.43,204.65],["an",204.65,204.81],["underground",204.81,205.17],["park",205.17,205.69],["and",205.69,205.91],["ride",205.91,206.13],["car",206.13,206.47],["park,",206.47,206.83],["so",207.29,207.59],["commuters",207.59,208.01],["can",208.01,208.27],["drive",208.27,208.57],["to",208.57,208.73],["the",208.73,208.83]]},{"start":208.83,"end":213.93,"text":"station, park and then ride to work on the train. That's the entrance to it on","words":[["station,",208.83,209.23],["park",209.57,209.91],["and",209.91,210.45],["then",210.45,210.61],["ride",210.61,210.91],["to",210.91,211.11],["work",211.11,211.31],["on",211.31,211.51],["the",211.51,211.59],["train.",211.59,211.89],["That's",212.57,212.95],["the",212.95,213.05],["entrance",213.05,213.29],["to",213.29,213.61],["it",213.61,213.73],["on",213.73,213.93]]},{"start":213.93,"end":218.87,"text":"the corner of Progress and Garden Road. You can drive into it from Progress","words":[["the",213.93,214.05],["corner",214.05,214.29],["of",214.29,214.63],["Progress",214.63,215.29],["and",215.29,215.75],["Garden",215.75,216.07],["Road.",216.07,216.43],["You",217.19,217.53],["can",217.53,217.65],["drive",217.65,217.89],["into",217.89,218.15],["it",218.15,218.31],["from",218.31,218.49],["Progress",218.49,218.87]]},{"start":218.87,"end":225.39,"text":"Road. Now on the Progress Road side of the site, on the top left of your map, is where","words":[["Road.",218.87,219.25],["Now",220.29,220.61],["on",220.61,220.91],["the",220.91,221.03],["Progress",221.03,221.35],["Road",221.35,221.73],["side",221.73,222.07],["of",222.07,222.23],["the",222.23,222.33],["site,",222.33,222.61],["on",223.15,223.31],["the",223.31,223.43],["top",223.43,223.69],["left",223.69,223.91],["of",223.91,224.13],["your",224.13,224.23],["map,",224.23,224.49],["is",224.81,225.19],["where",225.19,225.39]]},{"start":225.39,"end":230.73,"text":"we plan to put the bus interchange. Commuters will have direct access to the platform from","words":[["we",225.39,225.53],["plan",225.53,225.83],["to",225.83,226.05],["put",226.05,226.19],["the",226.19,226.31],["bus",226.31,226.51],["interchange.",226.51,226.75],["Commuters",227.97,228.43],["will",228.43,228.65],["have",228.65,228.83],["direct",228.83,229.13],["access",229.13,229.57],["to",229.57,229.83],["the",229.83,229.93],["platform",229.93,230.43],["from",230.43,230.73]]},{"start":230.73,"end":237.65,"text":"the bus interchange via a covered walkway. Cycling is an important part of our city's","words":[["the",230.73,230.85],["bus",230.85,231.07],["interchange",231.07,231.49],["via",231.49,232.29],["a",232.29,232.49],["covered",232.49,232.73],["walkway.",232.73,233.33],["Cycling",234.95,235.55],["is",235.55,235.81],["an",235.81,235.95],["important",235.95,236.47],["part",236.47,236.91],["of",236.91,237.09],["our",237.09,237.25],["city's",237.25,237.65]]},{"start":237.65,"end":243.53,"text":"transport plan, so cyclists will also be fully catered for with 80 new bicycle lockers.","words":[["transport",237.65,237.95],["plan,",237.95,238.39],["so",238.75,239.03],["cyclists",239.03,239.57],["will",239.57,239.73],["also",239.73,240.13],["be",240.13,240.35],["fully",240.35,240.67],["catered",240.67,241.17],["for",241.17,241.37],["with",241.37,241.85],["80",241.85,242.21],["new",242.21,242.55],["bicycle",242.55,242.99],["lockers.",242.99,243.53]]},{"start":244.07,"end":248.85,"text":"You can see where they are on the plan in the bottom left-hand corner next to the bike path.","words":[["You",244.07,244.59],["can",244.59,244.75],["see",244.75,244.97],["where",244.97,245.15],["they",245.15,245.27],["are",245.27,245.43],["on",245.43,245.55],["the",245.55,245.63],["plan",245.63,245.91],["in",245.91,246.21],["the",246.21,246.31],["bottom",246.31,246.51],["left",246.51,246.79],["-hand",246.79,247.01],["corner",247.01,247.43],["next",247.43,247.99],["to",247.99,248.19],["the",248.19,248.27],["bike",248.27,248.47],["path.",248.47,248.85]]},{"start":250.05,"end":254.73,"text":"Cyclists can ride to the station, store their bikes in the lockers and board the train.","words":[["Cyclists",250.05,250.57],["can",250.57,250.87],["ride",250.87,251.13],["to",251.13,251.29],["the",251.29,251.39],["station,",251.39,251.77],["store",252.23,252.59],["their",252.59,252.83],["bikes",252.83,253.13],["in",253.13,253.35],["the",253.35,253.43],["lockers",253.43,253.77],["and",253.77,254.07],["board",254.07,254.29],["the",254.29,254.45],["train.",254.45,254.73]]},{"start":255.43,"end":257.61,"text":"Oh, and I forgot the most important thing.","words":[["Oh,",255.43,255.63],["and",255.89,256.09],["I",256.09,256.31],["forgot",256.31,256.51],["the",256.51,256.73],["most",256.73,256.97],["important",256.97,257.29],["thing.",257.29,257.61]]},{"start":258.35,"end":261.45,"text":"You'll even be able to shower at the station after your bike ride,","words":[["You'll",258.35,258.65],["even